# Experimental section

# Materials

Thrombin (TB), potassium tetrachloropalladate \(\left(\mathrm{K}_{2}\mathrm{PdCl}_{4}\right)\), chloroplatinic acid
\(\left(\mathrm{H}_{2}\mathrm{PtCl}_{6}\right)_{\mathrm{0}}\) , gold chloride \(\mathrm{(HAuCl_{4})}\) , cetyl trimethyl ammonium bromide (CTAB), and hexanethiol \(96\%\) , HT) were bought from Sigma-Aldrich Chemical Co. (St. Louis, MO,  U.S.A.).  Cobaltous  nitrate  (Co \((\mathrm{NO}_{3})_{2}{\cdot}6\mathrm{H}_{2}\mathrm{O})\) ,  2-amino  terephthalic  acid \(\mathrm{NH}_{2}\) -BDC) was purchased from KeLong Chemical Co. (Chengdu, China). The nicking enzyme (Nt.AlwI, \(10000\ \mathrm{U/mL})\) and \(10\times\) NEB buffer ( \(500\ \mathrm{mM}\) NaCl, 100 mM Tris-HCl, \(100\;\mathrm{mM}\;\mathrm{MgCl}_{2}\) , and \(10\;\mathrm{mM}\) dithiothreitol, \(\mathrm{pH}\,7.9\\) ) were from the New England Biolabs (Ipswich, U.S.A.). The DNA was obtained from Sangon Biotech Co., Ltd. (Shanghai, China) and the sequences are listed in Table 1:

